{"title":"2020 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_(two_solutions_-_balancing_and_summing)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution (two solutions - balancing and summing)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c32764665959c19678173ea30b3653e2fcedd238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3, 5, 7, a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> have an average (arithmetic mean) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb03e37932205e8fcc3b5734e3a562b2a09f7b4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 30 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 45 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"389\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The arithmetic mean of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c32764665959c19678173ea30b3653e2fcedd238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3, 5, 7, a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ec5a494893f5a6ead231e8bb89068f7d26cb709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3+5+7+a+b}{5}=\\frac{15+a+b}{5}=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"287\" height=\"37\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/1/f8123d5bd2d394b2966bd8051e4ec80299676092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />. Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to find the average of the two numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/4/594cc3b823e6ede648a179e4b2b88595dde136da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28two_solutions_-_balancing_and_summing.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(two_solutions_-_balancing_and_summing)\">Solution (two solutions - balancing and summing)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (two solutions - balancing and summing)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know the average is 15. 3, 5, and 7 are, respectively, 12, 10, and 8 below the average. So far then we are -12 - 10 - 8 or 30 below the average. We have to make this up with a and b so on average each is 30/2 = 15 above the average. The average is 15 so each is on average 15+15 = 30, or answer C.\n</p><p>Incidentally we can immediately rule out answers A and B as being too small - with these we'd never catch up to get our average of 15. An alternative solution is that to get an average of 15 we need a sum of 15*5 = 75. We have 3, 5, and 7 which adds up to 15, so a and b must make up the remaining 75-15 = 60. 60/2 = 30 so the average of a and b is 30.\n</p>\n<pre>       ~Dilip\n</pre>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Education, The Study of Everything\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/e8Qfe5GpEUg\">https://youtu.be/e8Qfe5GpEUg</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WUcbVNy2uv0\">https://youtu.be/WUcbVNy2uv0</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-3sl1pSojc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-3sl1pSojc</a>\n</p><p>~bobthefam\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zVppmKOvx_w\">https://youtu.be/zVppmKOvx_w</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A\" title=\"2020 AMC 10A\">2020 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"externa